{"title": "Keen Attack", "pageid": 28105, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Keen_Attack", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Keen Attack</b> is a passive feature that greatly increases their chance to hit.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The wielder doubles their <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency Bonus\">Proficiency Bonus</a> when rolling ranged attacks with this weapon, unless they have Disadvantage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Dead_Shot\" title=\"The Dead Shot\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Dead_Shot\" title=\"The Dead Shot\">The Dead Shot</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The Keen Attack feature adds the wielder's proficiency bonus to the attack roll, even if the character is not proficient with longbows.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202307\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 849/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6701/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1671/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 688940/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   33.984      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   33.984      1 -total\n 57.86%   19.663      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 45.35%   15.412      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 41.91%   14.241      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 22.10%    7.510      1 Template:Item_icon\n 11.74%    3.989      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.73%    3.645      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 10.59%    3.599      1 Template:Hidden_code\n  7.72%    2.624      2 Template:ItemIcon_Internal\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28105-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202307 and revision id 371500. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}